{
  "sourceLanguage" : "en",
  "strings" : {
    "Action Button" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "操作按钮"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "動作按鈕"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opens Poki and starts talking." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "打开 Poki 并开始说话。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "打開 Poki 並開始說話。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Opens Poki and starts talking. If Poki is doing a task, it shows that task and leaves it running." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "打开 Poki 并开始对话。如果 Poki 正在执行任务，会直接显示当前任务并继续运行。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "開啟 Poki 並開始對話。如果 Poki 正在執行任務，會直接顯示目前任務並繼續執行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki couldn’t start the task. The chat says why." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki couldn’t start the task. Open the conversation to see why."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 未能启动该任务，请在对话中查看原因。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 無法啟動該任務，請在對話中查看原因。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki is still busy, so this task didn’t start. Here is what Poki is doing." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 正在处理其他任务，未启动新任务。以下是当前进度。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 正在處理其他任務，未啟動新任務。以下是目前進度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki started the task. Turn Poki on so it can act on the phone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 已接收任务。请开启 Poki，以便它操作此 iPhone。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 已接收任務。請開啟 Poki，以便它操作此 iPhone。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki starts the task on this iPhone and tells you when it is done." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 会在此 iPhone 上执行任务，并在完成后通知你。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 會在此 iPhone 上執行任務，並在完成後通知你。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Poki wasn’t ready. Try again in a moment." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 还没准备好，请稍后再试。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Poki 還沒準備好，請稍後再試。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Press and hold the Action button to open Poki and start talking. To type a task instead, choose Shortcut there, then Send Task. Control Center and the Lock Screen can hold Talk to Poki too." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按住操作按钮即可打开 Poki 并开始说话。如需改为输入文字任务，请在该处选择“快捷指令”，再选“发任务”。控制中心和锁定屏幕也可添加“和 Poki 说话”。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按住動作按鈕即可開啟 Poki 並開始說話。如需改為輸入文字任務，請在該處選擇「捷徑」，再選「發任務」。控制中心和鎖定畫面也可加入「和 Poki 說話」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Send ${task} to Poki" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "把 ${task} 发给 Poki"
